{"productId": "8d8a8725-f194-414b-921b-a65ee50ece90", "modelName": "Hawkeye Guide Gun", "modelDescription": "Based on the Hawkeye, the Guide Gun comes with Ruger's creep-free LC6 trigger. It comes with a removable radial muzzle brake. If you don't want to or can't use the muzzle brake, it comes with a muzzle weight that maintains the rifles point of impact as if the brake were attached. Like the Hawkeye, it has a stout hammer-forged barrel that's equipped with a band for slings. The forend also has a sling stud for different sling preferences or for use with a bipod. Although the Guide Gun has integral scope mounts and comes with rings, it's also got Express-type iron sights popular with big game rifles. The front sight is beaded and the rear sight is adjustable.", "manufacturerName": "Ruger", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "9a8af513-afbf-4bcf-9ad9-afc736412027", "description": "Ruger, Hawkeye Guide Gun, Bolt Action, 416 Ruger, 20\" Barrel, Matte Stainless Finish, Green Mountain Laminate Stock, Muzzle Brake, Iron Sights, Right Hand, 3 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/c616afdb-bab7-4fb0-9169-8ca1ba93db71", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/fa2b6de3-190c-45ec-be8f-61384dbfe072"], "isDefault": false, "manufacturerPartNumber": "47130", "upc": "736676471300", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "dc7a7e89-2701-44c0-a795-288bc55143bb", "attributeName": "Barrel Length", "attributeValueId": "bc23294e-268d-44d0-9d70-3969474a274f", "valueName": "20\""}, {"attributeNameId": "7c11c5f3-970e-4119-9b86-521429f6df57", "attributeName": "Stock Type", "attributeValueId": "6ab1c302-0e72-4112-b7ca-3d65086eee3c", "valueName": "Laminate"}, {"attributeNameId": "2ec4f4e1-4aed-47a2-bb02-cd7f86849836", "attributeName": "Hand", "attributeValueId": "324e63b7-c8e9-47bd-898b-de0f8eaa7ff6", "valueName": "Right"}, {"attributeNameId": "2765db68-a9f0-406d-8fb7-5b572b01f4ee", "attributeName": "Capacity